><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">⟨</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
